# Allowlist: nothing at the root deploys unless it is re-included below.
# Agent notes, run folders, build experiments, scripts and README media live in
# this folder too; ignoring by default keeps a new one off the public site.
# A new public root file (not .html, not under assets/) has to be added here.
/*

# Pages
!/*.html
# Archived copy of another business's site, not a Gabriel's page
/msm.html

# Everything the pages load
!/assets
!/scrollcraft.css
!/scrollcraft.js

# Served at fixed paths
!/favicon.ico
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/llms.txt

# Deploy config (read by Vercel, never served)
!/vercel.json

# Nothing under assets/ is documentation
/assets/**/*.md

# Static production build entry
!/scripts
/scripts/*
!/scripts/build-site.mjs
